Patches lib/versioncheck.php so Nextcloud 32 accepts PHP 8.5 (Ubuntu 26.04 ships no older PHP; ondrej PPA has no 26.04 builds).

Backup on server: /root/versioncheck.php.bak

--- a/lib/versioncheck.php
+++ b/lib/versioncheck.php
@@ -17 +17 @@
-if (PHP_VERSION_ID >= 80500) {
+if (PHP_VERSION_ID >= 80600) {

Re-apply after every Nextcloud upgrade (file gets overwritten):
  sed -i 's/PHP_VERSION_ID >= 80500/PHP_VERSION_ID >= 80600/' /var/www/nextcloud/lib/versioncheck.php
